                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00011         * ------------------------------------------------------------------
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00012         *   6      1999/05/11  Boisy G. Pitre
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00013         * Made compliant with 1900-2155.
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00014         *
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00015         *   7      2003/06/27  Rodney V. Hamilton
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00016         * Added 6309 bitfield instructions.
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00017         *
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00018         *   8      2003/07/28  Rodney V. Hamilton
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00019         * Enabled underscore and lowercase in symbols.
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00020         *
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00021         *   9      2004/03/20  Rodney V. Hamilton
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00022         * Added support for LDQ immediate, TFM register modes
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00023         * Copied the W indexed addressing code from ASM6309
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00024         * 0-register bug fixed, TFR now accepts R16->R8 xfers
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00025         * Added new IFDEF/IFNDF conditionals
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00026         *
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00027         *  10      2004/06/15  Rodney V. Hamilton
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00028         * Arbitrary-length labels allowed. (first 8 chars must be unique)
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00029         * Listing buffer overruns prevented. Opt W linewidth now 132 max.
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00030         * 6309 Reg2Reg ops now allow R16->R8 xfers. (sets warning flag)
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00031         * Listing fields spaced correctly, comment field auto-aligned.
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00032         *
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00033         *  10r1    2004/07/31  Rodney V. Hamilton
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00034         * Added "@" as valid symbol char. (but no local label support)
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00035         *
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00036         *  11      2019/03/25-2019/04/14  L. Curtis Boyle
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00037         * Minor optimizations, -O= will overwrite existing output file
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00038         * Expanded source line max length to 127 - I think it may work up to 132 fine (not tested)
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00039         * 6309 specific optimizations as well
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00040         *
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00041         *  11r1    2020/08/25-2020/08/30  L. Curtis Boyle
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00042         * Fixed bug in generating CRC's in programs that have lead in bytes before the module
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00043         *   header (like REL)
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00044         * Fixed bug on last line of mult-line listing if G option turned on and size >4 bytes
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00045         
