                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00079         * Notes on symbol table entries:
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00080         * There are two tables - one is pointed to by <u0010 (which is either 26 or 52 entries), each of which
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00081         * points to a linked list of symbol table entries that start with that letter (26 entries if uppercase
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00082         * only, 52 entries is upper/lowercase are treated separate). Each entry is 15 bytes:
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00083         * $0-$7   : 8 char symbol name
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00084         * $8      : Symbol type (0=undefined, 1=label, 2=SET, 3=EQU, 4=Data)
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00085         * $9-$A   : value of symbol
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00086         * $B-$C   : Linked list ptr to next "lower" (alphabetical) symbol tbl entry (within current start letter)
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00087         * $D-$E   : Linked list ptr to next "greater" (alphabetical) symbol tbl entry (within current start letter)
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00088         * A value of $0000 in the linked list pointers means no further ones in that direction
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00089         
0000.                 (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00090         u0000               rmb       2                   Ptr to source line input buffer (80 + CR)
0002.                 (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00091         u0002               rmb       2                   Ptr to header output buffer    (132 + CR)
0004.                 (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00092         u0004               rmb       2                   Ptr to listing output buffer   (132 + CR)
0006.                 (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00093         u0006               rmb       2                   Ptr to open file path stack    (13, Ustk)
0008.                 (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00094         u0008               rmb       2                   Ptr to Title buffer (TTL, 79 chars + nul)
000A.                 (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00095         u000A               rmb       2                   Ptr to Name buffer  (NAM, 39 chars + nul)
000C.                 (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00096         u000C               rmb       1                   temp postbyte storage for 6309 bit ops
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00097                             IFNE      DOCASE
000D.                 (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00098         u000D               rmb       1                   symbol case mask (was unused)
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00099                             ELSE
000D.                 (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00100         u000D               rmb       1                   unused
                      (vel1/cmds/asm.asm):00101                             ENDC      DOCASE
